Third-party components

This project links the following open-source Go modules at build time.
Their respective licenses apply to those components; see each module's
repository for the full text.

  - fyne.io/fyne/v2        BSD-3-Clause   (GUI toolkit)

At runtime the app shells out to built-in macOS command-line tools
(plutil, sips, open, codesign, xattr, lsregister) and links the macOS
system frameworks CoreServices, CoreFoundation, and Carbon via cgo.
These are part of macOS and are not redistributed with this project.
